      "content": "i dont know how much longer i can keep this up. my credit union is straight up trying to squeeze me out. first it was those random \"service fees\" that appeared out of nowhere, and now my debit card keeps getting declined for no reason even when i have funds. it's not just bad luck, they're clearly trying to trigger an intentional liquidation of my account to force me out of the area. i need to know how to play defense before they finish what they're doing. what can i do to stop them from draining me out?",
