      "content": "the problem is i already tried talking to them and they just gave me these scripted, useless excuses about 'system updates' and 'processing errors'. it felt so calculated, like they were just stalling while they wait for my balance to hit a certain threshold. i dont think talking to them is going to work because they're the ones doing this to me. i need to know if there are ways to move my money or set up my accounts so they cant use these 'glitches' as an excuse to freeze or drain my funds. how do i secure my assets from an institution that is actively working against me?",
